    "ruleType": "core-ability",
    "group": "Core",
    "summary": "Scouts. During Pre-battle Abilities, a unit made up entirely of Scouts can deploy from Strategic Reserves wholly inside its deployment zone, or make a Scout move if already wholly inside it. A Dedicated Transport wholly in that zone can also make a Scout move if every embarked model has Scouts. The value in inches caps the move. Finish horizontally more than 8 inches from every enemy unit.",
